                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a0effb78-589b-4a03-8f53-fd073c837911",
                                "sense_id": "78103337-c566-3ed3-987a-dc186278aa9d",
                                "text": "He continued in this strain for nearly an hour, mixing up transcendentalism, rationalism, unitarianism, and a number of other isms, so unartistically as to astonish and confound his audience, and give his hearers something to talk about for a week."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6855909-dd15-4091-806f-3293401804f3",
                                "sense_id": "78103337-c566-3ed3-987a-dc186278aa9d",
                                "text": "Those who desire to study the subject at length, will, no doubt, take the opportunity of consulting Mr. Jesse’s pages, which, we may here remark, will be found to be of very varied interest, and full of agreeable and useful information, though somewhat unartistically put together, and unsatisfactory in plan and arrangement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "729af9bf-e9eb-4dea-bbb6-755568bebfaa",
                                "sense_id": "78103337-c566-3ed3-987a-dc186278aa9d",
                                "text": "The breadth of course is lost in a bas-relief ; though the sculptor has rather unartistically given us three sides in one view."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
